          {
            "title": "Question: Square brackets",
            "id": 79838,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di mana tanda kurung siku <code>[ ]</code> dalam list diletakkan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Di sekitar semua nilai dalam list</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebelum nilai-nilai dalam list</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Di sekitar setiap nilai dalam daftar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Di sekitar semua nilai dalam list.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu memerlukan satu list berisi <code>\"Lima\"</code> dan <code>\"Oslo\"</code>. Penetapan mana yang menempatkan tanda kurung siku dengan benar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\", \"Oslo\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\"], [\"Oslo\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\", \"Oslo\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>cities = [\"Lima\", \"Oslo\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Any number",
            "id": 79796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa banyak nilai yang dimiliki list ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cats = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;whiskers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cats)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['whiskers', 'tom']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dua</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Satu</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nol</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Dua.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang disimpan oleh penetapan dalam <code>cats</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cats = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;whiskers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cats)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['whiskers', 'tom']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Satu list berisi dua nilai string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Satu list berisi satu string gabungan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">List kosong karena string berada di dalam tanda kutip</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Satu list berisi dua nilai string.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Square brackets",
            "id": 79834,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat list yang menyimpan <code>\"classic\"</code> dan <code>\"dark mode\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(themes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['classic', 'dark mode']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, dan terakhir <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat list yang menyimpan <code>\"classic\"</code> dan <code>\"dark mode\"</code> agar menampilkan <code>['classic', 'dark mode']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(themes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['classic', 'dark mode']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, dan terakhir <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Empty list",
            "id": 80451,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan tanda kurung siku <code>[ ]</code> untuk menetapkan list kosong ke <code>plans</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"plans = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(plans)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"10\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple values",
            "id": 80452,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan koma untuk menyimpan string lain dalam daftar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Federer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Murray&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Players for the match:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(players)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"50\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Players for the match:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['Federer', 'Murray']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Murray\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan pemain kedua, <code>\"Murray\"</code>, dalam list agar menampilkan <code>['Federer', 'Murray']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Federer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Murray&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Players for the match:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(players)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"50\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Players for the match:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['Federer', 'Murray']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Murray\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
