          {
            "title": "Example: Access element",
            "id": 79516,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Akses variabel <code>third</code> dalam list berdasarkan indeksnya, <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"first = \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"second = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joseph&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"third = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Donnie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"winners = [first, second, third]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(winners[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Donnie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 79467,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara mengakses elemen pertama dari list ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"test_scores = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>test_scores[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>test_scores[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>test_scores[90]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>test_scores[0]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah menjalankan <code>test_scores.pop(0)</code>, ekspresi mana yang mengambil <code>85</code> dari list?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"test_scores = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">test_scores[0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">test_scores[1]</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">test_scores[85]</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih test_scores[0].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
